### Basic enhance (WAV in, WAV out)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audio/enhance
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./src/main/resources/music/audio.wav
--boundary--

### Enhance with Demucs vocal isolation + MP3 output
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audio/enhance?demucs=true&format=mp3
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./src/main/resources/music/audio.wav
--boundary--

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health
